&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>Transform SCWindow coordinate</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/10/how-did-i-develop-mactoys-pin-window/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Oct 2024 11:24:35 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/10/how-did-i-develop-mactoys-pin-window/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>(Machine Translated)&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The coordinate system we use most is the standard Cartesian plane right-angle coordinate system, which takes the lower-left corner of the screen as the origin and increases the y coordinate upwards and the x coordinate to the right.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>SCWindow&amp;rsquo;s coordinates, on the other hand, are flipped coordinates with the upper-left corner of the main screen as the origin, and the following is a simple comparison chart:&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;figure>&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/posts/make-mactoys/flip-coordinate.png" alt="Flipped Coordinate" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/posts/make-mactoys/flip-coordinate.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/posts/make-mactoys/flip-coordinate.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/posts/make-mactoys/flip-coordinate.png?size=large 2x" data-title="Flipped Coordinate" style="--width: 424px;--aspect-ratio: 424 / 848;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;figcaption class="image-caption">Flipped Coordinate&lt;/figcaption>
 &lt;/figure>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>使用 CDN 低成本加速网站，或解决443和80端口被封问题</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/10/how-to-proxy-with-cdn/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Oct 2024 11:24:31 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/10/how-to-proxy-with-cdn/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>(TO BE TRANSLATED)&lt;/p>
&lt;p>CDN是个好东西，我们一般需要使用CDN，来让我们的网站能够在全球都能快速访问，并且降低服务器压力，防止DDOS攻击等。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>简单来说，你把你的域名的CNAME(如&lt;code>a.example.com&lt;/code>) 指向CDN厂商的域名(如&lt;code>abc.cloudfront.net&lt;/code>)。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>用户访问&lt;code>a.example.com&lt;/code>的时候，实际上访问的是&lt;code>abc.cloudfront.net&lt;/code>。&lt;code>abc.cloudfront.net&lt;/code>上面当然没有你的站点资源，所以会回头访问你配置的源站（这一步叫做&lt;code>回源&lt;/code>）拉取资源，并存储到本地（这一步叫做&lt;code>缓存&lt;/code>）。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>你也可以在站点发布后，第一时间让CDN拉取站点资源，并下发到它位于全球的站点，防止用户在高峰期一窝蜂地访问过来，导致源站压力过大。这一步叫做&lt;code>预热&lt;/code>。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>用户访问CDN厂商的域名，CDN会分配个给用户最近的站点，这样用户访问的速度也快了。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>CDN还支持指定回源的协议和端口，本文后面将会提及，这对使用家庭宽带部署服务并且443和80端口被封锁的用户非常有帮助。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>虽然我测试的域名在腾讯云，但是我并没有使用腾讯云的cdn服务，因为在选择试用的时候，腾讯云提示我没有资格。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>于是我只测试了cloudflare，aws，阿里云的cdn服务，并在此记录下来过程和配置，希望能够帮助有需要的人。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="cloudflare" class="heading-element">&lt;span>Cloudflare&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#cloudflare" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>右上角点 &lt;code>Add site&lt;/code>，增加你的域名，按照推荐的配置即可&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>How to replace the arm of DJI Mavic mini</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/09/how-to-replace-dji-mavic-mini-arm/</link><pubDate>Sat, 28 Sep 2024 11:24:31 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/09/how-to-replace-dji-mavic-mini-arm/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;h2 id="required-tools" class="heading-element">&lt;span>Required tools&lt;/span>
